**NOTES:**
- You have to configure/project your endpoint and model deployment (see Azure Portal, project, and deployment setup).
- Tool attachment/configuration depends on your tool schema/manifest (function tools, code interpreter).
- The SDK provides both synchronous (`PersistentAgentsClient`) and async (`PersistentAgentsAsyncClient`) variants.

